{"duration": 75.894, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "Florence Nightingale walked crowded wards at night, lamp in hand.", "start": 0.08, "end": 3.602}, {"beat": 0, "text": "Soldiers lay packed together in stale air.", "start": 3.822, "end": 5.911}, {"beat": 1, "text": "In 1854, the war hospital at Scutari had overcrowding, defective sewers, and poor ventilation.", "start": 6.331, "end": 12.785}, {"beat": 1, "text": "During her first winter there, 4,077 British soldiers died.", "start": 13.005, "end": 17.022}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Ten times more soldiers died from illness than from battle wounds.", "start": 17.242, "end": 20.796}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Nightingale blamed poor nutrition, missing supplies, stale air, and overworked soldiers.", "start": 21.216, "end": 26.374}, {"beat": 2, "text": "She sent a plea to The Times, begging the government to fix the hospitals.", "start": 26.594, "end": 30.282}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The new Renkioi Hospital had a death rate less than one tenth of Scutari's.", "start": 30.502, "end": 34.432}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The Sanitary Commission reached Scutari in March 1855, almost six months after Nightingale arrived.", "start": 34.652, "end": 41.098}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, a packed ward with no fresh air feels like a stuffy room you cannot escape.", "start": 41.518, "end": 45.768}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Nightingale concluded that poor living conditions killed most soldiers at the hospital.", "start": 46.188, "end": 50.67}, {"beat": 4, "text": "She collected evidence for the Royal Commission on the Health of the Army.", "start": 50.89, "end": 54.439}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Her Notes on Nursing turned ventilation lessons into practical advice.", "start": 54.659, "end": 58.61}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Then she turned to sanitary hospital design, including the pavilion model.", "start": 58.83, "end": 62.822}, {"beat": 5, "text": "The Sanitary Commission flushed the sewers and improved ventilation.", "start": 63.242, "end": 66.797}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Death rates fell sharply. Nightingale never claimed credit for the change.", "start": 67.017, "end": 70.917}, {"beat": 5, "text": "The lamp made her famous. Clean sewers and fresh air cut the deaths.", "start": 71.137, "end": 74.774}], "words": [{"w": "Florence", "start": 0.192, "end": 0.567, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Nightingale", "start": 0.617, "end": 1.192, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "walked", "start": 1.242, "end": 1.492, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "crowded", "start": 1.542, "end": 1.892, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "wards", "start": 1.942, "end": 2.192, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "at", "start": 2.217, "end": 2.267, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "night,", "start": 2.317, "end": 2.817, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "lamp", "start": 2.892, "end": 3.117, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "in", "start": 3.142, "end": 3.192, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "hand.", "start": 3.242, "end": 3.643, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Soldiers", "start": 3.912, "end": 4.362, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "lay", "start": 4.387, "end": 4.487, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "packed", "start": 4.537, "end": 4.787, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "together", "start": 4.837, "end": 5.187, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "in", "start": 5.237, "end": 5.337, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "stale", "start": 5.387, "end": 5.662, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "air.", "start": 5.712, "end": 5.998, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "In", "start": 6.4, "end": 6.5, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "1854,", "start": 6.55, "end": 7.75, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "the", "start": 7.8, "end": 7.875, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "war", "start": 7.925, "end": 8.125, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "hospital", "start": 8.175, "end": 8.625, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "at", "start": 8.675, "end": 8.725, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "Scutari", "start": 8.775, "end": 9.375, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "had", "start": 9.425, "end": 9.575, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "overcrowding